# The generated llms.txt files are compared byte-for-byte against the generator
# output by tools/llms-txt.test.js. core.autocrlf is on for most contributors, so
# without this they'd check out as CRLF and the golden-file test would fail on a
# fresh clone while passing right after `npm run docs`.
#
# A pattern with no slash matches at every directory level, the same rule
# .gitignore uses — so this one line covers rent-or-buy/llms.txt and
# build-or-invest/llms.txt as well as the root file. Check with:
#   git check-attr text eol -- llms.txt */llms.txt
#
# Deliberately scoped to these files: `* text=auto` would renormalise the whole
# repo in one commit.
llms.txt text eol=lf
